OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSaturday will start frosty for
OL,6,Fmany. Cloudier than on previous days,
OL,7,Fwith isolated showers in the far west.
OL,8,FHowever, sunny spells breaking through
OL,9,Fat times. Increasingly strong winds
OL,10,Ffor western coasts and hills, but a
OL,11,Fgentle breeze elsewhere. Feeling
OL,12,Fchilly.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FClear spells this evening,
OL,15,Fbut cloud thickening from the west
OL,16,Fovernight, bringing scattered showers.
OL,17,FThough temperatures will be higher
OL,18,Fthan previous nights, a touch of frost
OL,19,Fis still likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
