OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FSome bright spells on Sunday,
OL,6,Fbut also rain and showers which may be
OL,7,Fheavy, thundery, and frequent at
OL,8,Ftimes. Feeling chilly and unpleasant
OL,9,Fin the wet and increasingly blustery
OL,10,Fconditions.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCold
OL,13,Fand bright on Monday morning, perhaps
OL,14,Fwith a wintry shower. Rain arriving
OL,15,Flater, with hill snow overnight. Less
OL,16,Fchilly but showery on Tuesday and
OL,17,FWednesday. Colder air returning later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
